# Request one bundle of the latest image, GPS location and IMU.
# A service rather than a topic pair so the reply is reliable and matched to
# its request (rosbridge subscribes to topics best-effort, which drops large
# one-off messages).
---
# False when an input feed hasn't published yet; message says which.
bool success
string message
std_msgs/Header header
sensor_msgs/Image image
Coordinate location
sensor_msgs/Imu imu
